@host = http://localhost:5080

### Skapa en bedömning
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sector": "Energi",
  "employees": "50-249",
  "turnover": "10-50",
  "answers": { "1.1": "ja", "1.2": "delvis", "2.1": "nej" }
}

### Hämta bedömningen
GET {{host}}/api/assessments/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Ogiltig request ger 400 med valideringsfel
POST {{host}}/api/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employees": "massor", "answers": { "99.9": "kanske" } }

### Hälsokontroll
GET {{host}}/health
